      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had it there originally but it produces a warning `warning: mixing declarations and code is a C99 extension [-Wdeclaration-after-statement]`, which is a bit odd. It ends up as an error in future kernels with `-Werror`. This does nothing at runtime so it doesn\u0027t really matter where it ends up, but placing it here seemed logically more organized than at the top of `dma_buf_stats_setup` with no context yet on why the check exists.",
