      "writtenOn": "2022-06-02T20:36:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The previous allocation had to be zereod because that\u0027s what `kobject_init_and_add` expects. It doesn\u0027t work correctly otherwise. However `INIT_WORK` fully initializes its argument regardless of its initial state, so we no longer need zereoed memory here. Later in sysfs_add_workfn we have to overwrite this memory with zeros anyway before calling `kobject_init_and_add`.",
      "parentUuid": "ee5abadd_da806410",
